{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>And they brought out an evil report of the land.</b> A thing that never was. It is not so with \"and Joseph came,\" for \"and he came\" is the opposite of \"and they brought out.\"" "<b>Dibbah.</b> Of the doubled-letter roots, from the root of דובב שפתי ישנים. I explained it in its place." "<b>It eats its inhabitants.</b> That the air of it is bad." "<b>Men of measure.</b> Every man is a man of measure; only its sense is great measures, more than all. And likewise \"men of heart,\" and many like them."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:17:32.444633147Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}